{title: Yeshua}
{artist: Alessandro Vilas Boas}
{tempo: 68}
{time: 4/4}

{c: Verse 1}
[C]Meu orgulho me tirou do jardim[D]
MY PRIDE TOOK ME FROM THE GARDEN
